5. AI DISCLOSURE
================

Dedrel — the game system and its setting — has been in development for over ten
years. The rules, texts and concepts are almost exclusively written and designed
by the author; AI tools were used to assist with translation, editing and
brainstorming. The Foundry VTT system code was developed with AI coding
assistants (Claude Code, Google Antigravity). Generated artwork (tokens and
raster icons) was made with Google Gemini and AnimaYume.

All raster images in assets/ (.webp, .jpeg) are AI-generated. The SVG banners in
assets/banners/ and the skill icons assets/icons/skills/perception.svg and
assets/icons/skills/thievery.svg are original works of the author.


